Docker image = Bare minimum OS with minimal size + System  Packages + App run time + App code + App libraries
will be in mbs

Image is static, Server is running version of OS

If you run a image you get a container (Running instance of a image)

By default docker creates a docker group and only root user and users who are added in the docker group can execute the docker commands

